  m_text: A torn page from a forgotten journal, bearing the account of a creature bound to Death by an ancient pact. It tells of a beast that dwells beyond the Gates of Hell, devouring all who dare trespass upon its master's domain. The final lines are stained with blood, as though the writer never lived to finish his tale.
